counts[previous character][next character]
</comment><block type="pxt-on-start" id="#fHeBaf7.z@H*V)em;ZL" x="0" y="0"><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="variables_set" id="VaLtG*PIFHYKPB0eL!AB"><field name="VAR" id="GdI^[;eBbq:5DIHsQ.@r">ALPHABET</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">MicroSLM — single-file MakeCode program for BBC micro:bit V2
Paste this entire file into the MakeCode JavaScript editor.

Serial commands (USB serial, newline terminated):
GEN the little robot       Generate text from a prompt
LEARN the little robot ... Add text to the model's training counts
RESET                       Reset to the built-in training corpus
HELP                        Show commands

This is a compact character-level bigram statistical language model.
It learns transition frequencies from text and samples the next character.
It is not a neural network.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="`kOJxCRiO.$xojp8Bv=9"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text" id="G$r1c3e(2~$5G7-Ct0{E"><field name="TEXT">abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz </field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="mmR6Js~Axsl?VO=;pDgR"><field name="VAR" id="-v9L7DQZX|edpC/dtLUv">VOCAB</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="#d:kS~^OicJh`enU]S@g"><field name="NUM">27</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="G}x|!a0:?RHIokq~D1b2"><field name="VAR" id="{~3]tW/Q_ncO/5MG=loZ">MAX_OUTPUT</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="9jp%~)n~ape=}w}76ufJ"><field name="NUM">120</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="=chMcYOD0P+=hNvo#2vH"><field name="VAR" id=":*,x%2bqri@+r}6^TEf}">STARTER_TEXT</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="OYJH;RTNZ@hb+k^;T2!M"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="text_join" id="g~mlo~Ya53(@YFiOv(aY" inline="false"><mutation items="13"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="R|K_3{Dh}ZMKWWO/BquE"><field name="TEXT">the little robot is learning to speak. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><shadow type="text" id="_%(VbNSzaq-cF{5!R/dJ"><field name="TEXT">the robot can read and write words. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="text" id="2p7P|i3beH=ZGN}/*^iv"><field name="TEXT">once upon a time there was a tiny machine. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD3"><shadow type="text" id="m_N1e%0I:O4YhQhiYW)T"><field name="TEXT">the machine learned from examples. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD4"><shadow type="text" id="!;80I-?5Xul@@Ck^P:`T"><field name="TEXT">learning takes practice and patience. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD5"><shadow type="text" id="86:F{nzOhmXywt`KA(O2"><field name="TEXT">the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD6"><shadow type="text" id="]DQR-(Ttuv*I5/^n3zXe"><field name="TEXT">hello world. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD7"><shadow type="text" id="zj(U+fJM~adJ`dbjs:JE"><field name="TEXT">the small model predicts the next character. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD8"><shadow type="text" id="eSqbc5xe/)ullYCR:V~s"><field name="TEXT">the curious mouse explored the forest. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD9"><shadow type="text" id="*t93)oqE*$hlFagneP]P"><field name="TEXT">it found a little house near the river. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD10"><shadow type="text" id="eD90A)_K]Pi65)n.6wXa"><field name="TEXT">the sun is shining and the birds are singing. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD11"><shadow type="text" id="Vf@;C.Px@nz_.UsCge0W"><field name="TEXT">machines learn patterns from data. </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD12"><shadow type="text" id="#g0fOuLxG3#t^daTvQ^k"><field name="TEXT">the world is full of interesting things. </field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="basic_show_icon" id="@;kZsk6`cif}AUcM,%?m"><field name="i">IconNames.SmallDiamond</field><next><block type="serial_redirect_to_usb" id="?k0Ea?z8Z!.QE:;iEd?r"><next><block type="serial_setbaudrate" id="T]c:dO_-aSXiVQIl/8pD"><field name="rate">BaudRate.BaudRate115200</field><next><block type="function_call" id="m3G1h!dtlekhOXE:kg/O"><mutation name="trainStarterModel" functionid="OzVTt/Ao}BE--`z]u?SZ"></mutation><next><block type="serial_writeline" id="DsDH{1.tZvl{;ImoYrl/"><value name="text"><shadow type="text" id="EUQ7FaKp;z;zDLt~zS#5"><field name="TEXT"></field></shadow></value><next><block type="serial_writeline" id="zCLE@%N;o/Tace@QLQ?9"><value name="text"><shadow type="text" id="=NV=Z5T/WTtC;EB:lN5R"><field name="TEXT">MicroSLM ready — micro:bit V2</field></shadow></value><next><block type="serial_writeline" id="7Ox(DdIfa6t]pe2p7s5h"><value name="text"><shadow type="text" id="=Q|N^6KzfCte:9D3=Muk"><field name="TEXT">Type HELP for commands.</field></shadow></value><n